adaptation = "The report uses all A shares, weekly portfolio formation, raw price history, and next-week returns. The implementation uses adjusted close in the available daily universe, calendar weeks ending Friday, the last available trading session as week-end, and carries each completed-week prediction through the following week. The report's one-year listing, current suspension, and ST filters are preserved."
